  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to NPA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to continue NPA&apos;s long cooperation with key Myanmar civil society and ethnic democratic political parties in several states on peace and reconcilition efforts, as well as efforts promoting social cohesion. The context of the previous projects has been drastically changed after the February 1 coup, and NPA has adjusted all operations and activities in this new project.</narrative>
  </description>
